  "template": "<div lang=\"es\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/coleccion/moneda-colonial/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:64px 24px 96px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,58px); line-height:1.05; color:#d8d2cd; margin:0 0 24px;\">Catálogo de Moneda Colonial Americana</h1>\n\n    <p style=\"font-size:clamp(18px,1.8vw,21px); line-height:1.7; color:#d8d2cd; max-width:680px; margin:0 0 56px;\">Papel moneda emitido por las trece colonias británicas de Norteamérica antes de la independencia &mdash;expresado en libras, chelines y peniques, y autorizado por cada asamblea colonial bajo la autoridad nominal de la Corona.</p>\n\n    <section>\n      <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#b7ab8a; margin-bottom:14px;\">Provincia de Pensilvania</span>\n      <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,32px); color:#d8d2cd; margin:0 0 32px;\">Vísperas de la Revolución (1773)</h2>\n\n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 320px)); gap:28px;\">\n        <dc-import name=\"BanknoteCard\"\n          image=\"uploads/pennsylvania-colonial-5-shillings-1773.jpg\"\n          image-webp=\"uploads/pennsylvania-colonial-5-shillings-1773.webp\"\n          alt=\"Billete colonial de dos chelines y seis peniques y cinco chelines de Pensilvania, 1773, anverso y reverso\"\n          title=\"Provincia de Pensilvania\"\n          denomination=\"2s6d y 5 Chelines\"\n          year=\"1773\"\n          href=\"/coleccion/moneda-colonial/provincia-de-pensilvania/\"\n          hint-size=\"320px,300px\"\n        ></dc-import>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section style=\"margin-top:64px;\">\n      <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#b7ab8a; margin-bottom:14px;\">Colonia de Nueva Jersey</span>\n      <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,32px); color:#d8d2cd; margin:0 0 32px;\">Vísperas de la Independencia (1776)</h2>\n\n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 320px)); gap:28px;\">\n        <dc-import name=\"BanknoteCard\"\n          image=\"uploads/newjersey-6-shillings-1776-colonial.jpg\"\n          image-webp=\"uploads/newjersey-6-shillings-1776-colonial.webp\"\n          alt=\"Billete colonial de Seis Chelines de Nueva Jersey, 1776, anverso y reverso\"\n          title=\"Colonia de Nueva Jersey\"\n          denomination=\"Seis Chelines\"\n          year=\"1776\"\n          href=\"/coleccion/moneda-colonial/nueva-jersey-6-chelines-1776/\"\n          hint-size=\"320px,300px\"\n        ></dc-import>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
